  <title>2.8.2 Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00498</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.8.2 Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>27ee8511-9b1d-4185-aca8-41cd391fb866</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">A zookeeper feeds the tigers a meal of rabbits and chickens. The average rabbit weighs 4 pounds, and the average chicken weighs 5 pounds. Each tiger must eat at least 15 pounds of meat per day.The zookeeper writes the inequality \( 4x + 5y ≥ 15 \) to represent a tiger’s daily diet.What is meant by the letter \( y \) in the inequality above?</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
